 "description": "<p>Patent leather bunny suit in black with a genuine three-size run: S for 40-45 kg, M for 45-50 kg, L for 50-60 kg. The dark styling comes from the material - patent leather in black is the most aggressive surface in costume construction.</p>\n<p>The set runs rabbit ears, the suit itself, and a bracelet. Sized correctly, patent leather fits like it was poured; sized wrong, it fights. This listing is one of the few bunny options that lets you avoid the gamble.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: patent leather</li>\n<li>Includes: rabbit ears, suit, bracelet</li>\n<li>Style: dark bunny girl</li>\n<li>Color: black</li>\n<li>Sizing: S (40-45 kg), M (45-50 kg), L (50-60 kg)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Order by exact weight band - the 5 kg increments are real. Wipe-clean, camera-ready, and the ears hold their shape.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Black patent leather bunny suit with rabbit ears and bracelet in three exact sizes from S to L.</p>\n",
